    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 DESIGN YOUR DREAM SPACES</strong></h2>Unleash your inner interior designer! Start with your own dream home, then take on decorating jobs across a vibrant city. From cozy apartments to stylish villas and scenic retreats, every project is a relaxing, pressure-free creative outlet.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041940/extras/3c45ebf3ea07b525e54b1449b280771c.poster.avif?t=1755109684\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041940/extras/3c45ebf3ea07b525e54b1449b280771c.webm?t=1755109684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041940/extras/3c45ebf3ea07b525e54b1449b280771c.mp4?t=1755109684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc3e MEET YOUR FELINE CRITIC</strong></h2>You're not designing alone! A witty, talking cat acts as your companion and toughest critic, offering purr-fectly honest feedback as you work. The real challenge? Balancing client requests with the high standards of your furry friend.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041940/extras/01c81aeab73a521ce2e4832500c2c205.poster.avif?t=1755109684\" width=600 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041940/extras/01c81aeab73a521ce2e4832500c2c205.webm?t=1755109684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041940/extras/01c81aeab73a521ce2e4832500c2c205.mp4?t=1755109684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd1d TEAM UP WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2>Invite friends or family to join the fun! Collaborate on projects, share ideas, or divide and conquer\u2014one person can tackle the kitchen while another perfects the patio. It's a laid-back co-op experience all about creative expression, with no timers or scores to worry about.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udff0 GO BEYOND THE EVERYDAY</strong></h2>Your design journey isn't limited to houses. Get ready for unique creative gigs in castles, train cars, museums, and other unexpected locations. Each new project brings its own distinct style and story.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f EXPLORE THE WORLD</strong></h2>Expand your business as you unlock new regions and connect with clients from different cultures. Discover unique furniture, collect rare items, and build a design portfolio that's recognized around the globe.<br><br><strong>P.S.</strong><br>Decor Quest is where the zen of home design meets the joy of co-op creativity. It's your cozy digital dollhouse\u2014ready to be built and shared with friends.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 DESIGN YOUR DREAM SPACES</strong></h2>Unleash your inner interior designer! Start with your own dream home, then take on decorating jobs across a vibrant city. From cozy apartments to stylish villas and scenic retreats, every project is a relaxing, pressure-free creative outlet.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041940/extras/3c45ebf3ea07b525e54b1449b280771c.poster.avif?t=1755109684\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041940/extras/3c45ebf3ea07b525e54b1449b280771c.webm?t=1755109684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041940/extras/3c45ebf3ea07b525e54b1449b280771c.mp4?t=1755109684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc3e MEET YOUR FELINE CRITIC</strong></h2>You're not designing alone! A witty, talking cat acts as your companion and toughest critic, offering purr-fectly honest feedback as you work. The real challenge? Balancing client requests with the high standards of your furry friend.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041940/extras/01c81aeab73a521ce2e4832500c2c205.poster.avif?t=1755109684\" width=600 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041940/extras/01c81aeab73a521ce2e4832500c2c205.webm?t=1755109684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041940/extras/01c81aeab73a521ce2e4832500c2c205.mp4?t=1755109684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd1d TEAM UP WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2>Invite friends or family to join the fun! Collaborate on projects, share ideas, or divide and conquer\u2014one person can tackle the kitchen while another perfects the patio. It's a laid-back co-op experience all about creative expression, with no timers or scores to worry about.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udff0 GO BEYOND THE EVERYDAY</strong></h2>Your design journey isn't limited to houses. Get ready for unique creative gigs in castles, train cars, museums, and other unexpected locations. Each new project brings its own distinct style and story.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f EXPLORE THE WORLD</strong></h2>Expand your business as you unlock new regions and connect with clients from different cultures. Discover unique furniture, collect rare items, and build a design portfolio that's recognized around the globe.<br><br><strong>P.S.</strong><br>Decor Quest is where the zen of home design meets the joy of co-op creativity. It's your cozy digital dollhouse\u2014ready to be built and shared with friends.",
    "short_description": "\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udfa8\u2728\ud83c\udff0 A cozy decor sim. Design dream homes for whimsical clients, with help from a sassy cat critic. Enjoy solo or with friends in 2-4 player co-op.",
